        <details xmi:id="_84aDg5lvEeqEM7mFKilpXw" key="gmm-documentation" value="&lt;div&gt;This a UML model for the Hospital Management System. This a a first version which has to be improved. Butthe main entites are given.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;The hospital has several departments like Cardiology, Orthopedics, Pediatrics &amp;nbsp;etc. department.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;At reception the patient details are entered and the fees are also taken and the patient is tracked on the basis of his Id. &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;A patient can visit the doctors either directly selecting a doctor or by getting admitted to the hospital and then a doctor visits the patients.&lt;/div&gt;"/>
        <details xmi:id="_84aDhJlvEeqEM7mFKilpXw" key="author" value="asif"/>
        <details xmi:id="_84aDhZlvEeqEM7mFKilpXw" key="company" value="T5"/>
      </eAnnotations>
    </xmi:Extension>
